    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At <strong>20th Level</strong> once per Long Rest, when you hit enter <em>Ki Exhaustion</em> you may instead choose to regain half of your <strong>Maximum Ki</strong> as <strong>Temporary Ki</strong>. This <strong>Temporary Ki</strong> lasts for 1 minute of combat before dispelling. You may not gain <strong>Temporary Ki</strong> in any way while this <strong>Feature</strong> is ongoing.</p>\n",
